##### switch_cases

=== js ===
switch (x) {
  // a
  case 1:
    foo();
    // falls through
  case 2: // two
    bar();
  // end
}
---
// a -> Leading SwitchCase `case 1:
    foo();`
// falls through -> Leading SwitchCase `case 2: // two
    bar();`
// two -> Leading ExpressionStatement `bar();`
// end -> Trailing SwitchCase `case 2: // two
    bar();`

=== js ===
switch (x) {
  // only
}
---
// only -> Dangling SwitchStatement `switch (x) {
  // only
}`

